From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: The Playport authors <dev@playport.dev>
Date: Sat, 26 Sep 2026 00:26:35 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] ntdll-unix: port the unixlibs onto wine-11.18 (no bcrypt unix
 side, crypt32 PFX export, mmdevapi system threads, alpc)

wine-11.18 has no bcrypt unix library (SymCrypt on the PE side), so it is
neither built nor archived nor looked up. crypt32 gains upstream's
unix_export_cert_store (PFX export) and the GnuTLS symbol table its six new
functions. The null audio table follows 11.18's mmdevapi enum (main_loop_start
and main_loop_stop, no timer_loop), with the 10 ms timer on a system thread
joined in release_stream. libntdll_unix.a includes the new alpc.o.

Class: madeira-port
Evidence: docs/evidence/2026-09-26-wine-latest-rebase.md
Offered-upstream: no
